<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"/>
<meta content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" name="viewport"/>
<meta content="dark" name="color-scheme"/>
<meta content="#0b1016" name="theme-color"/>
<meta content="{{ content.meta_description }}" name="description"/>
<meta content="index,follow" name="robots"/>
<meta content="eMuleBB" name="author"/>
<meta content="{{ content.title }}" property="og:title"/>
<meta content="{{ content.meta_description }}" property="og:description"/>
<meta content="website" property="og:type"/>
<meta content="{{ page.url }}" property="og:url"/>
<meta content="eMule broadband edition" property="og:site_name"/>
<meta content="summary" name="twitter:card"/>
<link href="{{ page.url }}" rel="canonical"/>
<link href="{{ site_base_url }}/sitemap.xml" rel="sitemap" type="application/xml"/>
<link href="{{ page.favicon_href }}" rel="icon" type="image/x-icon"/>
<title>{{ content.title }}</title>
<link href="{{ pico_cdn }}" rel="stylesheet"/>
<link href="{{ page.stylesheet_href }}" rel="stylesheet"/>
<script async src="https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id={{ ga_measurement_id }}"></script>
<script>
      window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];
      function gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments);}
      gtag('js', new Date());
      gtag('config', '{{ ga_measurement_id }}');
    </script>
<script type="application/ld+json">
      {
        "@context": "https://schema.org",
        "@type": "SoftwareApplication",
        "name": {{ content.product.display_name | tojson }},
        "applicationCategory": "FileSharingApplication",
        "operatingSystem": ["Windows", "Linux", "macOS"],
        "url": "{{ page.url }}",
        "codeRepository": "https://github.com/emulebb/emulebb-rust",
        "downloadUrl": {{ content.product.nightly_url | tojson }},
        "softwareHelp": {{ content.product.docs_url | tojson }},
        "isAccessibleForFree": true,
        "description": {{ content.structured_description | tojson }}
      }
    </script>
</head>
<body>
<header class="site-header">
<a aria-label="eMuleBB home" class="brand brand-text" href="{{ site_base_url }}/">eMuleBB</a>
<button aria-controls="primary-nav" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Open primary navigation" class="menu-toggle" type="button">
<span class="menu-toggle-label">Menu</span>
</button>
<nav aria-label="Primary navigation" id="primary-nav">
<a href="{{ site_base_url }}/">Home</a>
<a class="nav-download" href="{{ content.product.nightly_url }}">Nightlies</a>
<a href="{{ content.product.docs_url }}">Docs</a>
<a href="{{ content.product.issues_url }}">Issues</a>
<a href="{{ site_base_url }}/faq/">FAQ</a>
</nav>
</header>
<main id="top">
<section class="hero rust-hero">
<div class="hero-copy">
<p class="eyebrow">{{ content.product.lifecycle_label }}</p>
<h1>{{ content.product.display_name }}</h1>
<p class="lead">Choose the newest dated nightly from GitHub Releases. {{ content.product.testing_summary }} {{ content.product.development_eta }}</p>
<div aria-label="eMuleBB Rust downloads" class="actions">
<a class="button primary" href="{{ content.product.nightly_url }}">Get Rust nightlies</a>
<a class="button secondary" href="{{ content.product.docs_url }}">Read product docs</a>
</div>
</div>
<aside aria-label="eMuleBB Rust status" class="hero-panel">
<p class="panel-kicker">Current status</p>
<h2>Active beta</h2>
<p>The nightly channel is the current testing lane. {{ content.product.development_eta }}</p>
<ul class="signal-list">
<li>CI-gated builds from <code>main</code></li>
<li>Windows, Linux, and macOS packages</li>
<li>SHA-256 checksums and provenance attestations</li>
<li>Live eD2K/Kad network testing</li>
</ul>
</aside>
</section>
<section class="section motivation" id="downloads">
<div class="section-heading">
<p class="eyebrow">Choose a build</p>
<h2>Nightly first, Beta 3 after stabilization, maintained MFC available</h2>
<p>Each lane has a different purpose. Start with Rust unless you specifically need the maintained Windows client.</p>
</div>
<div aria-label="eMuleBB product lanes" class="motivation-grid">
<article>
<span>Primary</span>
<h3>eMuleBB Rust nightlies</h3>
<p>Use the newest CI-gated build for current beta testing and issue reports.</p>
<a href="{{ content.product.nightly_url }}">Browse nightlies</a>
</article>
<article>
<span>Upcoming</span>
<h3>{{ content.product.development_target }}</h3>
<p>{{ content.product.development_eta }}</p>
<a href="{{ content.product.issues_url }}">Follow stabilization</a>
</article>
<article>
<span>Maintained Windows</span>
<h3>eMuleBB MFC 0.7.3</h3>
<p>The MFC 0.7.x line remains published for diagnostics, critical fixes, and bounded maintenance.</p>
<a href="{{ content.mfc_url }}">Open MFC 0.7.3</a>
</article>
</div>
</section>
<section class="section docs" id="start">
<div class="section-heading">
<p class="eyebrow">Start and report</p>
<h2>Use a current package and keep the report reproducible</h2>
<p>Download from GitHub Releases, verify the published checksum, keep important profiles backed up, and report the exact version, platform, and network path.</p>
</div>
<div class="guide-grid guide-compact">
<article>
<span>01</span>
<h3>Download</h3>
<p>Choose the newest dated nightly prerelease for active testing.</p>
</article>
<article>
<span>02</span>
<h3>Verify</h3>
<p>Check <code>SHA256SUMS</code> and retain the release or nightly URL with your test notes.</p>
</article>
<article>
<span>03</span>
<h3>Report</h3>
<p>Include the package, operating system, eD2K/Kad path, reproduction steps, and relevant logs.</p>
</article>
</div>
<div class="doc-list">
<a href="{{ content.product.docs_url }}"><strong>eMuleBB Rust docs</strong><span>Setup, release scope, compatibility, and product references.</span></a>
<a href="{{ content.product.issues_url }}"><strong>Issue tracker</strong><span>Report reproducible defects and live-network regressions.</span></a>
<a href="{{ content.contributing_url }}"><strong>Contributing guide</strong><span>Help with code, tests, documentation, packaging, or validation.</span></a>
<a href="https://github.com/emulebb/emulebb-rust"><strong>Source repository</strong><span>Inspect the client, package workflows, and current development.</span></a>
</div>
</section>
</main>
<footer>
<span>eMuleBB Rust</span>
<div aria-label="Footer links" class="footer-links">
<a href="{{ site_base_url }}/">Home</a>
<a href="{{ site_base_url }}/faq/">FAQ</a>
<a href="https://github.com/emulebb">GitHub</a>
</div>
</footer>
<script>
      (function () {
        var button = document.querySelector(".menu-toggle");
        var nav = document.getElementById("primary-nav");
        if (!button || !nav) return;
        function setOpen(open) {
          nav.classList.toggle("is-open", open);
          button.setAttribute("aria-expanded", String(open));
          button.setAttribute("aria-label", open ? "Close primary navigation" : "Open primary navigation");
        }
        setOpen(false);
        button.addEventListener("click", function () {
          setOpen(button.getAttribute("aria-expanded") !== "true");
        });
        nav.addEventListener("click", function (event) {
          if (event.target && event.target.closest("a")) setOpen(false);
        });
      })();
    </script>
</body>
</html>
